{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"42f2d7367f71bd3eb6abb24b1e4660413db7683c95141d4274406f0b211b3b53","ja":"えっ！？　あっ、ありがとう……！？\nえっと……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"6e1cd1d868bd5b4b529e0ab4121740076347fd55e17f7e2d01579d883e053979","ja":"はい。このお姉さんは、\n今日来てくれるヒーローが大好きなのです。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"e9ed36b13993590f49cadebbf33a409d20cab88bbf1c7258d5782b4535bfecd4","ja":"「ボクも大好き～！」「ねぇねぇ。このまえ、\nイエローがレッドにダメって言ってたけど、なんで？」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"6619dc6c74207de23d31176cdda53921d099a25beacd6f2248b220ce8f6f69b5","ja":"あ……それはね。イエローが止めたのは、\nレッドが危なかったからで……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"b166d0e5c7389d2e52fb6dab5e2639560c9ec2156a0a747bc82e6907ba1ca2c5","ja":"「へぇ～、そうなんだ！」「ねえ、そっちの\nおねえちゃんは、どんな技が好きなの？」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"991b3a593f330eeed710180987ba0e064a3d31922a7b7e86d55eee8e0ad2a1f9","ja":"ディープスカーレットです。技を出すときの、\nピンクのポーズが好きです。……しゃきーん。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"f4b2bf6216adb7f328c3424f005d9d56e9ff34c6ffaaa641e6adae8430d25a94","ja":"子どもたちとの会話に盛り上がるふたりだったが、\n数十分後、会場に不穏な空気が漂い始めて……","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"99569d60bbbdcef23928b1b22212a63b0dd9f0677d281bfc18518715fc4570bf","ja":"「ねえねえ、ショー、まだ始まらないの？」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"3e7856d9ab7af34d3bf87b3c358c4f2b1c73f03ec6be355304a9bf8602f17001","ja":"開演時間は、だいぶすぎてますね。\n……なにかあったのでしょうか？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"53bf8a2428f937c51e3e67d7b240ccd1b6c10701fd68cb06719d3c065b1b0614","ja":"そうですね……どうしたんでしょう？\n……あっ、アナウンスが……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"3125fd105b3e98f4d817629757dc826308d307454fada4198c785daaa7404f82","ja":"「ただ今、トラブルのため開演を見合わせております。\n大変申し訳ございませんが、開演時間は未定で……」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"c6d02534b785b99f699e70f39e0b86ea1ee867cfeb754226973a2fe17506e943","ja":"「ええ～～～っ！？」「ねえねえ、おねえちゃん。\nまだまつの～！」「早くレッドにあいたいよ～！」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
